  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sachin S/O Nanaji Lekkalwar vs The State Of Maharashtra Through Pso Mul ... on 8 August, 2024 Author: Vinay Joshi Bench: Vinay Joshi 1/2 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Nagpur Bench, Nagpur. Criminal Application (Apl) No.1044 Sachin Nanaji Lekkalwar -Vs-State of Maharashtra ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Office notes, Office Memoranda of Coram, appearances, Court's orders or directions and Registrar's orders. ------ ------------------------------------------------------------------------ Mr. S.A.Mohta, Adv. for the applicant. Ms.K.H.Bhondge, A.P.P for non-applicant -State. Coram Vinay Joshi & Mrs. Vrushali V. Joshi, J Date : 8th August, 2024. 1. Heard. 2. This is an application seeking to quash the First Information Report No.180 of 2024 dated 25.04.2024 for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 273, 272, 328 r/w 34 of the Indian Penal Code along with Sections 26(2)(a),30(2),3,4 and 59(i) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 registered with Police Station Mul district Chandrapur. 3. It is argued that on the basis of statement of the co-accused, the applicant has been arraigned in the crime stating him to be supplier. Besides that it is the applicant's contention that the action taken by the police is not maintainable. Sachin S/O Nanaji Lekkalwar vs The State Of Maharashtra Through Pso Mul ... on 8 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/11516822/ 1 4.",
